    the packet looks like,
        TankPacket(type=APP_INTEGRITY_FAIL, value=2, vector_x=1730.0, vector_y=674.0, vector_x2=3.221020221710205, vector_y2=0, target_net_id=0)

    with value being the status code.
    its sent by the client when a cheat is detected, there are a couple of type of cheats:

    ITEM_DATA_MISMATCH (5): when the items database is modified (checked with a set of hardcoded item id, if one mismatches then it triggers this)
